# Wallet

## Audit

- Wallet transaction phai co kha nang audit.
- KHONG sua/xoa lich su giao dich tuy tien.

## Field nhat quan

Moi WalletTransaction phai co:

- balance_after - BigDecimal, snapshot sau khi cong/tru.
- amount - BigDecimal, duong = cong, am = tru.
- transaction_type - enum: TOPUP, WITHDRAW, ORDER_PAYMENT, ORDER_REFUND, COMMISSION, ...
- order_id - nullable, FK orders.
- payment_id - nullable, FK payments.
- status - SUCCESS / PENDING / FAILED.
- created_at - timestamp.

## Quy tac

- Moi transaction phai di qua 1 WalletService method duy nhat (single entry point).
- @Transactional dam bao wallet.balance update + wallet_transactions insert atomic.
- Kiem tra balance >= amount truoc khi tru.
- Khi can dong bo nhieu user (vi du: 2 user settle wallet cung luc) -> su dung PESSIMISTIC_WRITE o repository.

## Endpoint (placeholder)

- GET /api/v1/wallets/me - Xem vi cua toi.
- GET /api/v1/wallets/me/transactions - Lich su (paging).
- POST /api/v1/wallets/me/topup - Tao yeu cau nap.
- POST /api/v1/wallets/me/withdraw - Tao yeu cau rut.

> Hien chua co WalletController - module wallet/controller/ chi co .gitkeep. Khi implement phai tuan thu rule tren va bo sung API list vao endpoints-payment-wallet-review.mdc.

## Khi implement

- Endpoint Contract phai duoc liet ke trong docs/api/api-document.md.
